  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RESPONSE TO THE CHOLERA OUTBREAK THROUGH WASH AND HEALTH SUPPORT TO AFFECTED COMMUNITIES., WHICH INCLUDES TECHNICAL AND FINANCIAL SUPPORT TO THE GOVER</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x2018;Responding to the cholera outbreak with lifesaving support&#x2019;. The project aims to provide un-earmarked support to UNICEF&#x2019;s response to cholera, which will support Case Management and Support to Health Facilities, and WASH/Risk Communication and Community Engagement (RCCE) in affected provinces. This will be done in close coordination with the government and other NGOs, leveraging UNICEF&#x2019;s lead role in the WASH cluster, participation in the Health cluster, and lead role in the RCCE working group, and in alignment with the Addendum to the HRP.</narrative>
  </description>
